      "title_zh": "和奶奶看电影",
      "title_en": "A film with Grandma",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["上次", "我", "去", "奶奶", "家", "，", "我们", "一起", "看", "了", "一", "个", "日本", "电影", "。"],
        ["电影", "里", "有", "一", "个", "老人", "，", "她", "很", "爱", "唱歌", "。", "奶奶", "说", "：", "“", "她", "跟", "我", "一样", "！", "”"],
        ["电影", "有", "两", "个", "小时", "，", "奶奶", "一", "点", "也", "不", "想", "睡", "。"],
        ["最后", "，", "她", "也", "唱", "了", "一", "个", "歌", "。", "我", "听", "了", "很", "高兴", "。"],
        ["我", "想", "，", "下次", "我", "还", "要", "和", "她", "一起", "看", "电影", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Last time I went to Grandma's, we watched a Japanese film together.",
        "In the film there's an old woman who loves singing. Grandma said: “She’s just like me!”",
        "The film was two hours long, but Grandma wasn’t sleepy at all.",
        "At the end, she sang a song too. It made me really happy.",
        "I think next time I’ll watch a film with her again."
      ],
      "names": ["日本"],
      "new_words": ["上次", "奶奶", "唱歌"],
      "glossary": [
